Package: AgriDesign
Title: Design and Analysis of Agricultural Experiments
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Luis Ángel", "Barrera-Guzmán", , "lbarrerag@chapingo.mx", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8057-2583"))
Description: Plans and analyses agricultural experiments with classical
    designs: completely randomised, randomised complete blocks (also
    generalised), Latin squares, incomplete blocks, augmented designs,
    factorials, split-plots, strip-plots, split-split-plots and nested
    designs, with or without covariates. Each analysis of variance uses
    the right error stratum for every term, reports least-squares means
    and their standard errors, and checks the assumptions of the model.
    The package is written in base R only and has no dependencies on
    other packages.
